  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MHPSS Expert with United Nations High Commissioner for Refugees (UNHCR) in Chad</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MHPSS is a major under addressed need in the current emergency in East Sudan with an estimated 190,000 new arrival in last months. Many of whom have experienced atrocities and hardships. There are urgent immediate needs around MHPSS that should be addressed. The overall aim is to integrate MHPSSwithin the local humanitarian response.</narrative>
  </description>
